      "content": "thanks but it's not just about being tired or needing quiet. it's like, they're literally sacrificing their lives to manage my mess. i watch my husband struggle just to help me get around and i just think... wouldn't life just be so much easier for them if they didn't have to worry about me anymore? like if they were actually free?",
